    {
      "id": "scene-02-travel",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2000,
      "description": "Mine tunnel with coal cart and miner walking with headlamp, diamond glowing in the coal — carbon in transit through the earth",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-02-travel.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Work that got noticed.",
            "enter": 3000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 15,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Work that was expected.",
            "enter": 5000,
            "exit": 8000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 21,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody called that much of nothing but being a good wife.",
            "enter": 29000,
            "exit": 33000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 78,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "text": "That's how I was raised.",
            "enter": 41000,
            "exit": 44000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 84,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I learned early the difference between work that got noticed and work that was just expected.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6000
          },
          {
            "text": "Daddy would come home covered in black coal and it was a badge of honor.",
            "start": 6000,
            "end": 11000
          },
          {
            "text": "That meant he'd worked hard and he was respected for it.",
            "start": 11000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "Mommy and Mawmaw kept the rest of the world from falling apart—",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "the youngins to school, doing the running, supper on the table.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 23000
          },
          {
            "text": "And it was always fixed and hot.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 26000
          },
          {
            "text": "Problem was, nobody called that much of nothing but being a good wife.",
            "start": 26000,
            "end": 32000
          },
          {
            "text": "So that's what I learned.",
            "start": 32000,
            "end": 34000
          },
          {
            "text": "Work like it mattered and keep on moving whether anybody sees it or not.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 40000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's how I was raised.",
            "start": 40000,
            "end": 42000
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "regions": [
          {
            "type": "glow",
            "mask": "assets/masks/mask-02-travel-diamond.png",
