    {
      "id": "scene-03-reach",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 3000,
      "description": "Hand reaching toward diamond in a pile of burning coals, intense fire behind — carbon released as heat at the threshold of use",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-03-reach.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Growing up was a hard thing to do.",
            "enter": 2000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Hot enough to ruin a person.",
            "enter": 13000,
            "exit": 15000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 22,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Something in me just refused to burn.",
            "enter": 17000,
            "exit": 20000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 28,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "Stubborn.",
            "enter": 22000,
            "exit": 24000,
            "x": 85,
            "y": 85,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "I'll tell you what—growing up was a hard thing to do.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 4000
          },
          {
            "text": "Seemed like every time I got my feet under me, something else would come along and knock them back out again.",
            "start": 4000,
            "end": 10000
          },
          {
            "text": "More than once, life came at me hot enough to ruin a person.",
            "start": 10000,
            "end": 16000
          },
          {
            "text": "Liked to have killed me, if I'm being honest.",
            "start": 16000,
            "end": 19000
          },
          {
            "text": "But something in me just refused to burn.",
            "start": 19000,
            "end": 23000
          },
          {
            "text": "And I don't know what you'd call it except stubborn.",
            "start": 23000,
            "end": 29000
          },
          {
            "text": "I just figured as long as I had fight left in me, then fighting is just what I'd do.",
            "start": 29000,
            "end": 36000
          },
          {
            "text": "Turns out that sort of thinking probably saved my life a time or two over the years.",
            "start": 36000,
            "end": 43000
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "regions": [
          {
            "type": "heat",
            "mask": "assets/masks/mask-03-reach-heat.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "glow",
            "mask": "assets/masks/mask-03-reach-diamond.png",
            "color": 16775408,
            "glowAlpha": 0.15,
            "distance": 15,
            "outerStrength": 3,
            "pulseSpeed": 0.02,
            "pulseDepth": 0.4
