    {
      "id": "scene-05-rinse",
      "frameType": "scene",
      "holdAfterNarration": 2500,
      "description": "Hands holding diamond with circuitry under running water in a metal sink, coins in basin — carbon entering the water cycle",
      "image": "assets/images/scene-05-rinse.webp",
      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Trained in all the hard things.",
            "enter": 3000,
            "exit": 5000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 12,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Put on your big girl panties.",
            "enter": 9000,
            "exit": 12000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 18,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "The dust started washing off.",
            "enter": 29000,
            "exit": 31000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 78,
            "align": "right"
          },
          {
            "text": "Nobody expected that to look like me.",
            "enter": 36000,
            "exit": 40000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 84,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "By the time I found my way into tech, I'd already been trained in all the hard things.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every time I thought about quitting school, I'd think of my Mommy telling me to put on my big girl panties.",
            "start": 6000,
            "end": 12000
          },
          {
            "text": "She still tells me that.",
            "start": 12000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "And that was just our way of saying just because it's hard don't mean you ain't gonna do it.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "So I used all the stubbornness and grit I got from the mountains",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 26000
          },
          {
            "text": "and did a whole lot of just showing up until I finished school.",
            "start": 26000,
            "end": 29000
          },
          {
            "text": "Somewhere along the way, the dust started washing off.",
            "start": 29000,
            "end": 34000
          },
          {
            "text": "Turns out what was under it was rightly what this kind of work needed.",
            "start": 34000,
            "end": 39000
          },
          {
            "text": "Now, I don't think nobody was quite expecting that to look like me by the time I got there.",
            "start": 39000,
            "end": 46000
          },
          {
            "text": "I didn't rightly care neither.",
            "start": 46000,
            "end": 48000
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": {
        "regions": [
          {
            "type": "water",
            "mask": "assets/masks/mask-05-rinse-water.png"
          },
          {
            "type": "glow",
