      "narration": {
        "lines": [
          {
            "text": "Smart things.",
            "enter": 4000,
            "exit": 6000,
            "x": 10,
            "y": 10,
            "align": "left"
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hot coal I walked straight across.",
            "enter": 15000,
            "exit": 17000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 50,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "I decided to cut one of my own.",
            "enter": 20000,
            "exit": 24000,
            "x": 50,
            "y": 56,
            "align": "center"
          },
          {
            "text": "That's exactly how you build anything worth having.",
            "enter": 30000,
            "exit": 34000,
            "x": 75,
            "y": 88,
            "align": "right"
          }
        ],
        "captions": [
          {
            "text": "For now, I'll build things. Smart things.",
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6000
          },
          {
            "text": "That's what a girl from a little old coal town can do when she gets her hands on the right parts.",
            "start": 6000,
            "end": 13000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hard thing I've done.",
            "start": 13000,
            "end": 15000
          },
          {
            "text": "Every hot coal I walked straight across led me right here.",
            "start": 15000,
            "end": 20000
          },
          {
            "text": "Not cause of a path I found, but because I decided a long time ago to cut one of my own.",
            "start": 20000,
            "end": 27000
          },
          {
            "text": "And this work ain't always pretty. Sometimes it's hands and wires and not knowing if it'll hold.",
            "start": 27000,
            "end": 35000
